  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>L'Atelier De Croustille is located on avenue Maréchal Lyautey, in Cavalaire-sur-Mer, for grooming your dog during your stay in the Gulf of Saint-Tropez. The salon is recent: its Facebook page celebrated "already 2 months of opening" in a post of 5 June, i.e. an opening in early spring 2026, and still shows no reviews.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The salon's Facebook page presents it as a "dog and cat grooming salon", 484 avenue Maréchal Lyautey, 83240 Cavalaire-sur-Mer, with 07 83 55 77 71 as the contact number. It publishes no hours, prices or admission conditions (size, weight or number of dogs): these points are settled by phone, before travelling.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: call before travelling to find out opening days, prices and whether your dog can be taken in.</div>
      <p><strong>Check before you go:</strong> hours of Tuesday to Friday 9am to 6pm and Saturday 9am to 2pm have circulated, without a dated source; the Cavalaire tourist office also lists a nail-bar business at the same address, which suggests shared premises. Sources read on 12/11/2026: the salon's Facebook page, the Cavalaire tourist office website.</p>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The centre of Cavalaire-sur-Mer is close by, on the same avenue as several other businesses in the area.</p>
